meUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">The Mountain</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_5274142\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget direct_download ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_3560395\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" class=\"game_frame game_pending\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 360px\"><div class=\"iframe_placeholder\" data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/17224601/index.html?v=1782617103&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg height=\"24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" width=\"24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p></p>\r\n<p><strong>The Mountain</strong>\r\n </p>\r\n<p>Knowledge dies with people.\r\n </p>\r\n<p>The Mountain is a colony builder about what gets passed down before it&#x27;s too late. Progress isn&#x27;t permanent &mdash; it lives with your citizens. When your last skilled smith before training an apprentice, the forges go dark and nobody in the colony know how to oprate it.\r\n </p>\r\n<p>Carve your colony into the rock. Assign workers. Train apprentices before your elders die. Elevate the worthy to elder status and watch lineages form across generations &mdash; children inheriting the skills and names of their parents.\r\n </p>\r\n<p>Build The Commons &mdash; a monument to every elder whose knowledge made it possible.\r\n </p>\r\n<p><strong>Tips</strong>\r\n </p>\r\n<ul> <li>Your elder is always aging. Check who holds knowledge no one else does &mdash; that&#x27;s your most important citizen&nbsp;</li><li>High-tier buildings make your colony anxious. Use the heart overlay to see how your layout affects reproduction:<br>Red zones block new births. <br>Green zones boost them.</li></ul>\r\n<ul><li>Lineages carry knowledge buffs to their children &mdash; mixed lineage children inherit both parents&#x27; skills\r\n </li><li>When the colony looses an important citizen, the knowledge isn&#x27;t gone forever. Train someone to take their place&nbsp;&mdash; the mountain remembers\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<p>How To Play -</p><p>Right click and drag to move camera</p><p>Right click to cancel selection</p><p>Dig - remove rock to reveal space to build rooms</p><p>Build - select building</p><p>Citizen&#x27;s are in the right screen, press a citizen then a building with room to place him</p><p>ToolTips - Hover over most things to show info about them</p><p>Have Fun!!!!</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>Would love to get real and honest feedback here!!</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>patch 1.0-</p>\r\n<p>added full screen mode. press F11, or click in the settings menu (corner top right)</p>\r\n<p>minor fixes</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden width=\